  "translation": "Eliezeru, Dodawahu denkɛ, min bɔra Maresha (Mareʃa), o ye nabiya kɛ Yehoshafat kan na, ko: “Sabu i farala Ahaziahu (Ahaziya) kan, Yawe ye ⟨את⟩ i baaraw tugun.” Anwaw tun tugunna, u tun ma se ka taa Tarshishi (Tarʃiʃi) .",
